				},
				{
					"id": 750691303,
					"content": "What are you doing here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750691304,
					"content": "I'm... a warrior of the adventure team. Not one as mighty as our leader, Lord Taika, but I do have my strengths.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691305,
					"content": "I guard our camp... Sometimes, when I can't sleep at night, I patrol to keep the camp safe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691306,
					"content": "Now, I don't know when it started, but there have been fewer and fewer people in camp every day... Huh, wait. Strange... Why am I here now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691307,
					"content": "You hear other things?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750691308,
					"content": "Yes, and only here at the waterfall can the sound of water drown them out...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691309,
					"content": "Can't you hear it? Someone whimpers by your ear, like one who is dying but cannot scream, making only the sound of their lungs struggling for air.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691310,
					"content": "And then, you will see a pale face, staring at you with anger. A face... like your own.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691311,
					"content": "Ah, only at the waterfall, only there can I escape those haunting sounds. Hehe, can't you hear them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750691312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691312,
					"content": "Stay here for too long, brave warrior, and you might end up like me. So, leave while you can.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Quenin"
				},
				{
					"id": 750691313,
					"content": "Nope, don't need anything.",
